<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise 884 mln in latest week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise 884 mln in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to April 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka, compared with April 15.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 61,325	60,441</p>
<p> Money market intervention    17,070	14,854</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,904	 1,904</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,248	 2,253</p>
<p> Other				 6,824	 6,826</p>
<p> Total assets		     89,371	86,254</p>
<p>In the previous week, to April 15, reserves rose by 1.15 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
